&lt;h1 id=&#34;bytebot-open-source-ai-desktop-agent&#34;&gt;Bytebot: Open-Source AI Desktop Agent
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://trendshift.io/repositories/14624&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://trendshift.io/api/badge/repositories/14624&#34; alt=&#34;bytebot-ai%2Fbytebot | Trendshift&#34; style=&#34;width: 250px; height: 55px;&#34; width=&#34;250&#34; height=&#34;55&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An AI that has its own computer to complete tasks for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://railway.com/deploy/bytebot?referralCode=L9lKXQ&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
