&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://bytebot.ai&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;🌐 Website&lt;/a&gt; • &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.bytebot.ai&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
